# Aegisub (Qt 6 Quick) Licensing Terms

This project is licensed under a combination of permissive open-source licenses, reflecting the original contributions of the Aegisub upstream developers alongside newly authored Qt Quick architecture by Cuptu.

---

## 1. Newly Authored Front-end, Controls & QRHI Graphics (MIT License)

The following components are designed, implemented, and copyrighted by **Cuptu**:
- All desktop-native QML controls in `qml/controls/`
- All UI views, panels, and dialog components in `qml/` (`qml/views/`, `qml/dialogs/`, `qml/project/`, `qml/Main.qml`)
- Hardware QRHI spectrogram shaders and scene-graph materials in `shaders/`, `src/audio/SpectrogramItem.*`, `src/audio/SpectrogramShaderMaterial.*`
- Modern runtime and core bridge interfaces in `src/bridge/`

